{
  "info": {
    "name": "NexoCommerce - Fase 1: Autenticacion y Usuarios",
    "description": "Coleccion completa para probar los endpoints de la Fase 1.\n\nFlujo sugerido:\n1. Registro -> Login -> usar el token en las rutas protegidas\n2. El token se guarda automaticamente en la variable `token` tras cada login exitoso\n3. Las rutas de admin requieren hacer login con un usuario ADMIN\n\nVariable de entorno requerida: `base_url` (ej: http://localhost:8001/api/v1)",
    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json"
  },
  "variable": [
    {
      "key": "base_url",
      "value": "http://localhost:8001/api/v1",
      "type": "string"
    },
    {
      "key": "token",
      "value": "",
      "type": "string"
    },
    {
      "key": "usuario_id",
      "value": "",
      "type": "string"
    }
  ],
  "item": [
    {
      "name": "00. Healthcheck",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "GET salud",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{base_url}}/salud",
              "host": ["{{base_url}}"],
              "path": ["salud"]
            },
            "description": "Verifica que la API este activa."
          },
          "response": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "01. Autenticacion - Publicas",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "POST auth/registro",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "exec": [
                  "const res = pm.response.json();",
                  "if (res.success && res.data && res.data.token) {",
                  "    pm.collectionVariables.set('token', res.data.token);",
                  "    console.log('Token guardado:', res.data.token);",
                  "}",
                  "if (res.data && res.data.usuario && res.data.usuario.id) {",
                  "    pm.collectionVariables.set('usuario_id', res.data.usuario.id);",
                  "}"
                ],
                "type": "text/javascript"
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              { "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" },
              { "key": "Accept", "value": "application/json" }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"nombre_completo\": \"Juan Perez\",\n  \"correo\": \"juan@ejemplo.com\",\n  \"password\": \"Password123*\",\n  \"password_confirmation\": \"Password123*\",\n  \"telefono\": \"+51987654321\",\n  \"terminos_aceptados\": true,\n  \"version_terminos\": \"1.0\"\n}"
            },
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{base_url}}/auth/registro",
              "host": ["{{base_url}}"],
              "path": ["auth", "registro"]
            },
            "description": "TC-01: Registra un nuevo usuario CLIENTE.\nEspera 201 con envelope { success, message, data: { usuario, token } }.\nGuarda el token automaticamente en la variable de coleccion."
          },
          "response": [
            {
              "name": "201 - Registro exitoso",
              "status": "Created",
              "code": 201,
              "body": "{\n  \"success\": true,\n  \"message\": \"Registro exitoso\",\n  \"data\": {\n    \"usuario\": {\n      \"id\": 1,\n      \"nombre_completo\": \"Juan Perez\",\n      \"correo\": \"juan@ejemplo.com\",\n      \"rol\": \"CLIENTE\",\n      \"correo_verificado\": false,\n      \"activo\": true,\n      \"creado_en\": \"2026-09-22T20:30:00.000000Z\"\n    },\n    \"token\": \"1|abcdef...\"\n  }\n}"
            },
            {
              "name": "422 - Correo duplicado (TC-02)",
              "status": "Unprocessable Content",
              "code": 422,
              "body": "{\n  \"success\": false,\n  \"message\": \"El correo ya esta registrado\",\n  \"data\": {\n    \"errors\": {\n      \"correo\": [\"El correo ya esta registrado\"]\n    }\n  }\n}"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "POST auth/registro - correo duplicado (TC-02)",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              { "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" },
              { "key": "Accept", "value": "application/json" }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"nombre_completo\": \"Otro Usuario\",\n  \"correo\": \"juan@ejemplo.com\",\n  \"password\": \"Password123*\",\n  \"password_confirmation\": \"Password123*\",\n  \"terminos_aceptados\": true,\n  \"version_terminos\": \"1.0\"\n}"
            },
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{base_url}}/auth/registro",
              "host": ["{{base_url}}"],
              "path": ["auth", "registro"]
            },
            "description": "TC-02: Intenta registrar un correo ya existente.\nEspera 422 con error en el campo 'correo'."
          },
          "response": []
        },
        {
          "name": "POST auth/login - exitoso",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "exec": [
                  "const res = pm.response.json();",
                  "if (res.success && res.data && res.data.token) {",
                  "    pm.collectionVariables.set('token', res.data.token);",
                  "    console.log('Token guardado:', res.data.token);",
                  "}",
                  "if (res.data && res.data.usuario && res.data.usuario.id) {",
                  "    pm.collectionVariables.set('usuario_id', res.data.usuario.id);",
                  "}"
                ],
                "type": "text/javascript"
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              { "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" },
              { "key": "Accept", "value": "application/json" }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"correo\": \"juan@ejemplo.com\",\n  \"password\": \"Password123*\",\n  \"device_name\": \"postman\"\n}"
            },
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{base_url}}/auth/login",
              "host": ["{{base_url}}"],
              "path": ["auth", "login"]
            },
            "description": "Inicia sesion con credenciales validas.\nGuarda el token automaticamente."
          },
          "response": [
            {
              "name": "200 - Login exitoso",
              "status": "OK",
              "code": 200,
              "body": "{\n  \"success\": true,\n  \"message\": \"Sesion iniciada\",\n  \"data\": {\n    \"usuario\": {\n      \"id\": 1,\n      \"nombre_completo\": \"Juan Perez\",\n      \"correo\": \"juan@ejemplo.com\",\n      \"rol\": \"CLIENTE\",\n      \"correo_verificado\": false,\n      \"activo\": true\n    },\n    \"token\": \"2|xyz789...\"\n  }\n}"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "POST auth/login - credenciales invalidas",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              { "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" },
              { "key": "Accept", "value": "application/json" }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"correo\": \"juan@ejemplo.com\",\n  \"password\": \"PasswordIncorrecta\",\n  \"device_name\": \"postman\"\n}"
            },
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{base_url}}/auth/login",
              "host": ["{{base_url}}"],
              "path": ["auth", "login"]
            },
            "description": "TC-03: Intento fallido. Incrementa intentos_fallidos.\nDespues de 5 intentos fallidos consecutivos, la cuenta se bloquea 15 min (TC-04 -> 429)."
          },
          "response": [
            {
              "name": "401 - Credenciales invalidas",
              "status": "Unauthorized",
              "code": 401,
              "body": "{\n  \"success\": false,\n  \"message\": \"Credenciales invalidas\",\n  \"data\": {\n    \"codigo_error\": \"AUTH_CREDENCIALES_INVALIDAS\"\n  }\n}"
            },
            {
              "name": "429 - Cuenta bloqueada (TC-04, tras 5 fallos)",
              "status": "Too Many Requests",
              "code": 429,
              "body": "{\n  \"success\": false,\n  \"message\": \"Cuenta temporalmente bloqueada\",\n  \"data\": {\n    \"codigo_error\": \"AUTH_CUENTA_BLOQUEADA\"\n  }\n}"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "POST auth/login - como ADMIN",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "exec": [
                  "const res = pm.response.json();",
                  "if (res.success && res.data && res.data.token) {",
                  "    pm.collectionVariables.set('token', res.data.token);",
                  "    console.log('Token ADMIN guardado:', res.data.token);",
                  "}"
                ],
                "type": "text/javascript"
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              { "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" },
              { "key": "Accept", "value": "application/json" }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"correo\": \"admin@nexocommerce.com\",\n  \"password\": \"Password123*\",\n  \"device_name\": \"postman-admin\"\n}"
            },
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{base_url}}/auth/login",
              "host": ["{{base_url}}"],
              "path": ["auth", "login"]
            },
            "description": "Login con cuenta ADMIN. Usa las credenciales reales del admin en tu DB de desarrollo.\nTraskl login exitoso, el token queda en la variable de coleccion y puedes usar las rutas /admin/*."
          },
          "response": []
        },
        {
          "name": "POST auth/oauth - GOOGLE",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "exec": [
                  "const res = pm.response.json();",
                  "if (res.success && res.data && res.data.token) {",
                  "    pm.collectionVariables.set('token', res.data.token);",
                  "}"
                ],
                "type": "text/javascript"
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              { "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" },
              { "key": "Accept", "value": "application/json" }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"proveedor\": \"GOOGLE\",\n  \"id_proveedor\": \"google-uid-123456\",\n  \"nombre_completo\": \"Maria Garcia\",\n  \"correo\": \"maria@gmail.com\",\n  \"terminos_aceptados\": true,\n  \"version_terminos\": \"1.0\"\n}"
            },
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{base_url}}/auth/oauth",
              "host": ["{{base_url}}"],
              "path": ["auth", "oauth"]
            },
            "description": "RN-AUTH-09: Autentica via OAuth.\n- Si el par (proveedor, id_proveedor) ya existe -> login\n- Si el correo existe pero sin OAuth -> vincula la cuenta + login\n- Si nada existe -> crea usuario nuevo (password_hash=NULL, correo_verificado=true) + login"
          },
          "response": [
            {
              "name": "200 - OAuth exitoso",
              "status": "OK",
              "code": 200,
              "body": "{\n  \"success\": true,\n  \"message\": \"Sesion iniciada\",\n  \"data\": {\n    \"usuario\": {\n      \"id\": 2,\n      \"nombre_completo\": \"Maria Garcia\",\n      \"correo\": \"maria@gmail.com\",\n      \"rol\": \"CLIENTE\",\n      \"correo_verificado\": true,\n      \"activo\": true\n    },\n    \"token\": \"3|oauth_token...\"\n  }\n}"
            },
            {
              "name": "422 - Proveedor invalido (TC-06)",
              "status": "Unprocessable Content",
              "code": 422,
              "body": "{\n  \"success\": false,\n  \"message\": \"El campo proveedor seleccionado es invalido\",\n  \"data\": {\n    \"errors\": {\n      \"proveedor\": [\"El campo proveedor seleccionado es invalido\"]\n    }\n  }\n}"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "POST auth/oauth - proveedor invalido (TC-06)",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              { "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" },
              { "key": "Accept", "value": "application/json" }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"proveedor\": \"FACEBOOK\",\n  \"id_proveedor\": \"fb-uid-999\",\n  \"nombre_completo\": \"Pedro Lopez\",\n  \"correo\": \"pedro@ejemplo.com\",\n  \"terminos_aceptados\": true,\n  \"version_terminos\": \"1.0\"\n}"
            },
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{base_url}}/auth/oauth",
              "host": ["{{base_url}}"],
              "path": ["auth", "oauth"]
            },
            "description": "TC-06: Proveedor no permitido (solo GOOGLE; FACEBOOK u otros → 422).\nEspera 422 con error en el campo 'proveedor'."
          },
          "response": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "02. Autenticacion - Protegidas (requieren token)",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "GET auth/perfil",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [
              { "key": "Accept", "value": "application/json" },
              { "key": "Authorization", "value": "Bearer {{token}}" }
            ],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{base_url}}/auth/perfil",
              "host": ["{{base_url}}"],
              "path": ["auth", "perfil"]
            },
            "description": "Retorna el perfil completo del usuario autenticado incluyendo terminos_aceptados y version_terminos."
          },
          "response": [
            {
              "name": "200 - Perfil del usuario",
              "status": "OK",
              "code": 200,
              "body": "{\n  \"success\": true,\n  \"message\": \"Perfil obtenido\",\n  \"data\": {\n    \"id\": 1,\n    \"nombre_completo\": \"Juan Perez\",\n    \"correo\": \"juan@ejemplo.com\",\n    \"telefono\": \"+51987654321\",\n    \"rol\": \"CLIENTE\",\n    \"correo_verificado\": false,\n    \"activo\": true,\n    \"terminos_aceptados\": true,\n    \"version_terminos\": \"1.0\",\n    \"creado_en\": \"2026-09-22T20:30:00.000000Z\"\n  }\n}"
            },
            {
              "name": "401 - Sin token",
              "status": "Unauthorized",
              "code": 401,
              "body": "{\n  \"message\": \"Unauthenticated.\"\n}"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "POST auth/verificar-correo",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              { "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" },
              { "key": "Accept", "value": "application/json" },
              { "key": "Authorization", "value": "Bearer {{token}}" }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"codigo\": \"123456\"\n}"
            },
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{base_url}}/auth/verificar-correo",
              "host": ["{{base_url}}"],
              "path": ["auth", "verificar-correo"]
            },
            "description": "Verifica el correo del usuario con el codigo de 6 digitos enviado al registrarse.\nEl codigo real esta en la tabla verificaciones_correo de tu DB de desarrollo."
          },
          "response": [
            {
              "name": "200 - Correo verificado",
              "status": "OK",
              "code": 200,
              "body": "{\n  \"success\": true,\n  \"message\": \"Correo verificado correctamente\",\n  \"data\": null\n}"
            },
            {
              "name": "400 - Codigo invalido o expirado",
              "status": "Bad Request",
              "code": 400,
              "body": "{\n  \"success\": false,\n  \"message\": \"El codigo de verificacion es invalido o ha expirado\",\n  \"data\": {\n    \"codigo_error\": \"AUTH_CODIGO_INVALIDO\"\n  }\n}"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "POST auth/reenviar-verificacion",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              { "key": "Accept", "value": "application/json" },
              { "key": "Authorization", "value": "Bearer {{token}}" }
            ],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{base_url}}/auth/reenviar-verificacion",
              "host": ["{{base_url}}"],
              "path": ["auth", "reenviar-verificacion"]
            },
            "description": "Genera un nuevo codigo de verificacion de correo para el usuario autenticado.\nEn desarrollo el codigo aparece en la tabla verificaciones_correo."
          },
          "response": [
            {
              "name": "200 - Codigo reenviado",
              "status": "OK",
              "code": 200,
              "body": "{\n  \"success\": true,\n  \"message\": \"Codigo de verificacion reenviado\",\n  \"data\": null\n}"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "POST auth/logout",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              { "key": "Accept", "value": "application/json" },
              { "key": "Authorization", "value": "Bearer {{token}}" }
            ],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{base_url}}/auth/logout",
              "host": ["{{base_url}}"],
              "path": ["auth", "logout"]
            },
            "description": "Revoca el token actual. Despues de esto el token queda invalido."
          },
          "response": [
            {
              "name": "200 - Logout exitoso",
              "status": "OK",
              "code": 200,
              "body": "{\n  \"success\": true,\n  \"message\": \"Sesion cerrada\",\n  \"data\": null\n}"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "POST auth/logout - sin token (TC-05)",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              { "key": "Accept", "value": "application/json" }
            ],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{base_url}}/auth/logout",
              "host": ["{{base_url}}"],
              "path": ["auth", "logout"]
            },
            "description": "TC-05: Intenta logout sin Bearer token.\nEspera 401 Unauthenticated."
          },
          "response": [
            {
              "name": "401 - Sin token",
              "status": "Unauthorized",
              "code": 401,
              "body": "{\n  \"message\": \"Unauthenticated.\"\n}"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "03. Usuarios - Perfil propio (requieren token)",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "PUT usuarios/perfil",
          "request": {
            "method": "PUT",
            "header": [
              { "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" },
              { "key": "Accept", "value": "application/json" },
              { "key": "Authorization", "value": "Bearer {{token}}" }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"nombre_completo\": \"Juan Perez Actualizado\",\n  \"telefono\": \"+51999888777\"\n}"
            },
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{base_url}}/usuarios/perfil",
              "host": ["{{base_url}}"],
              "path": ["usuarios", "perfil"]
            },
            "description": "Actualiza nombre_completo y/o telefono del usuario autenticado.\nSolo estos dos campos; correo y rol no se pueden cambiar aqui."
          },
          "response": [
            {
              "name": "200 - Perfil actualizado",
              "status": "OK",
              "code": 200,
              "body": "{\n  \"success\": true,\n  \"message\": \"Perfil actualizado\",\n  \"data\": {\n    \"id\": 1,\n    \"nombre_completo\": \"Juan Perez Actualizado\",\n    \"correo\": \"juan@ejemplo.com\",\n    \"telefono\": \"+51999888777\",\n    \"rol\": \"CLIENTE\",\n    \"correo_verificado\": false,\n    \"activo\": true\n  }\n}"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "PUT usuarios/cambiar-password - exitoso",
          "request": {
            "method": "PUT",
            "header": [
              { "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" },
              { "key": "Accept", "value": "application/json" },
              { "key": "Authorization", "value": "Bearer {{token}}" }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"password_actual\": \"Password123*\",\n  \"password_nuevo\": \"NuevoPassword456!\",\n  \"password_nuevo_confirmation\": \"NuevoPassword456!\"\n}"
            },
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{base_url}}/usuarios/cambiar-password",
              "host": ["{{base_url}}"],
              "path": ["usuarios", "cambiar-password"]
            },
            "description": "Cambia la password del usuario autenticado.\nRN-USR-05: Falla con 400 si la cuenta es solo OAuth (no tiene password local)."
          },
          "response": [
            {
              "name": "200 - Password cambiada",
              "status": "OK",
              "code": 200,
              "body": "{\n  \"success\": true,\n  \"message\": \"Password actualizada correctamente\",\n  \"data\": null\n}"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "PUT usuarios/cambiar-password - actual incorrecta (TC-08)",
          "request": {
            "method": "PUT",
            "header": [
              { "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" },
              { "key": "Accept", "value": "application/json" },
              { "key": "Authorization", "value": "Bearer {{token}}" }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"password_actual\": \"PasswordIncorrecta\",\n  \"password_nuevo\": \"NuevoPassword456!\",\n  \"password_nuevo_confirmation\": \"NuevoPassword456!\"\n}"
            },
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{base_url}}/usuarios/cambiar-password",
              "host": ["{{base_url}}"],
              "path": ["usuarios", "cambiar-password"]
            },
            "description": "TC-08: Envia la password actual incorrecta.\nEspera 400 con codigo_error AUTH_PASSWORD_ACTUAL_INCORRECTO."
          },
          "response": [
            {
              "name": "400 - Password actual incorrecta",
              "status": "Bad Request",
              "code": 400,
              "body": "{\n  \"success\": false,\n  \"message\": \"La password actual es incorrecta\",\n  \"data\": {\n    \"codigo_error\": \"AUTH_PASSWORD_ACTUAL_INCORRECTO\"\n  }\n}"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "PUT usuarios/cambiar-password - cuenta OAuth sin password local",
          "request": {
            "method": "PUT",
            "header": [
              { "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" },
              { "key": "Accept", "value": "application/json" },
              { "key": "Authorization", "value": "Bearer {{token}}" }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"password_actual\": \"cualquier-cosa\",\n  \"password_nuevo\": \"NuevoPassword456!\",\n  \"password_nuevo_confirmation\": \"NuevoPassword456!\"\n}"
            },
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{base_url}}/usuarios/cambiar-password",
              "host": ["{{base_url}}"],
              "path": ["usuarios", "cambiar-password"]
            },
            "description": "RN-USR-05: Usuario que se registro solo via OAuth (password_hash=NULL).\nEspera 400 con codigo_error AUTH_SIN_PASSWORD_LOCAL.\nPrimero haz login con un usuario OAuth para que el token sea de ese usuario."
          },
          "response": [
            {
              "name": "400 - Sin password local",
              "status": "Bad Request",
              "code": 400,
              "body": "{\n  \"success\": false,\n  \"message\": \"Esta cuenta no tiene password local configurada\",\n  \"data\": {\n    \"codigo_error\": \"AUTH_SIN_PASSWORD_LOCAL\"\n  }\n}"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "04. Admin - Usuarios (requieren token ADMIN)",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "GET admin/usuarios - listar todos",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [
              { "key": "Accept", "value": "application/json" },
              { "key": "Authorization", "value": "Bearer {{token}}" }
            ],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{base_url}}/admin/usuarios",
              "host": ["{{base_url}}"],
              "path": ["admin", "usuarios"]
